# NAV-STACK - every write-free way back to the tabs, one after another in one
# session. After each, the root stack must hold exactly one screen (the tabs).
# Before Priority 2 the flows left the root stack at 2, 3, 5 and 6 screens in turn.
# Today's 'Canvas Sync is already yours' sheet opens 1.2 s after a Today mounts
# (twice per device at most); a fresh tab navigator mounts a fresh Today.
launch
sleep 5
tapif Cerrar/Close
rootstack launch expect=1
note 1 - added.tsx 'Done for now'
openurl semora://syllabus/added?count=3
sleep 4
scroll 0.7 0.4
sleep 1.5
tap Listo por ahora/Done for now
sleep 3
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs done-for-now
rootstack done-for-now expect=1
note 2 - added.tsx 'Add another class'
openurl semora://syllabus/added?count=3
sleep 4.5
tap Agregar otra clase/Add another class
sleep 3
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs add-another-class
rootstack add-another-class expect=1
note 3 - +not-found 'Go to home screen!'
openurl semora://this-screen-does-not-exist
sleep 3
tap Ir a la pantalla de inicio/Go to home screen!
sleep 3
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs not-found-home
rootstack not-found-home expect=1
note 4 - paywall post-scan close without a course
openurl semora://paywall?context=postScan&count=3
sleep 4
tap Cerrar/Close
sleep 3
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs paywall-postscan-close
rootstack paywall-postscan-close expect=1
